Description: systemd service introspection and managed mutations for Runix
 Read-only systemd introspection (units, timers, journal) and managed service
 mutations for the Runix framework, routing durable audit through the Runix
 broker.
 .
 Experimental. Part of Runix (https://github.com/cornball-ai/runix).
